<title>USA: Ill. $150.5 mln bonds repriced, top yield 5.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Ill. $150.5 mln bonds repriced, top yield 5.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it repriced Illinois Toll Highway Authority's $150.5 million refunding revenue bond issue, cutting yields in several maturities and lowering the top yield in 2009 to 5.50 percent from 5.55 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>ILLINOIS STATE TOLL HIGHWAY AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $150,540,000*</p>
<p>TOLL HIGHWAY REFUNDING REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>1996 SERIES A</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING.</p>
<p>THE VERBAL AWARD RECEIVED</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa / A1	    S&amp;P: AAA / A+  FITCH: AAA / AA-</p>
<p>FGIC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 09/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>01/01/1997		2,900M    5.00  %	  3.74</p>
<p>01/01/1998	     16,000M    5.00  %	  4.10</p>
<p>01/01/1999		5,985M    5.25  %	  4.45</p>
<p>01/01/2000		9,990M    5.00  %	  4.70</p>
<p>01/01/2001	     10,455M    4.70  %	  4.80</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>01/01/2002	     10,960M    4.80  %	  4.90</p>
<p>01/01/2003	     11,500M    4.90  %	  5.00</p>
<p>01/01/2004	     12,075M    5.50  %	  5.10</p>
<p>01/01/2005	     12,700M    5.10  %	  5.20</p>
<p>01/01/2006	     13,370M    5.20  %	  5.30</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>01/01/2007	     14,075M    6.00  %	  5.35</p>
<p>01/01/2008	     14,850M    6.00  %	  5.43</p>
<p>01/01/2009	     15,680M    6.00  %	  5.50</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, September 19, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 10, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
